      "author": "Tried By Fire",
      "authorHandle": "@TriedByFire",
      "text": "This will be the first (and not last) time that Solomon provides a human attribute to wisdom. Wisdom is seeking to pour into people. She desires that people know her and that they would use her for the right cause. Those that are evil will not find her or hear her, or even desire to be around her. Those that are righteous will hear the cry of wisdom, and they will seek her out to gain as much knowledge as they can from her. The ones that desire to know wisdom understand how little they actually know. Those that don't desire think they already know it all.",
