      "text": "Honestly, they will think that their fruit is the best thing in the world. They will think that there is nothing better than their sin. They will enjoy it, and they won't desire anything better because they will have to give up the fruit of their sin to take the better fruit of the Spirit. Because of this, they will not have success in this life, or the one to come. They will think they are prospering, but in the end they will have been dead wrong, and their treasures will be fleeting.",
