          "verse": 0,
          "startVerse": 0,
          "endVerse": 0,
          "author": "Tried By Fire",
          "authorHandle": "@TriedByFire",
          "text": "The book of Proverbs is a fascinating one, full of instruction and insight into the lifestyle of a godly person vs. the lifestyle of the world. We have two contrasting characters woven throughout this entire book. Solomon will speak about a young man quite often, and it is assumed to be personal stories when he speaks about him.",
          "likes": 0,
          "isLikedByUser": false,
          "isBookmarkedByUser": false,
          "createdAt": "2026-09-23T00:00:00.000Z",
          "kind": "comment",
